GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "CCB99BE817D06F29"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{9674E64C3E8E8AB8}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "There has been heavy separatist activity in the area. We have been informed by a reliable source that there is a separatist camp located on the island on the Zherebets river. We have been tasked with doing a dawn raid on the island to destroy any enemy combatants and any cashes on the island. "\
     ""\
     "The time is 0600"\
     ""\
     ""\
     "Note: The island might not currently be visible on the map"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{4673552BF3AF2808}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "The Canadians have been spotted by the locals to our east and are coming towards our camp. We must set up in defensive positions and prepare for the attack. "\
     ""\
     ""\
     "Note: The island might not currently be visible on the map"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D8D4654CA9DEF6BD}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Overview"
     m_sContent "Canadian Forces assault a Separatist held position."
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{649206D4E3F3E72E}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Situation Enemy"
     m_sContent "The recce element has reported a platoon minus of separatists on the Zherebets island. They are well armed with warsaw packed weapons. They are wearing a mismatch of uniforms including VSR, Flora, EMR, multicam and ATACS woodland. The platoon also includes some well equipped and well trained mercenaries most likely in leadership positions. "\
     ""\
     "There are a few shallow points that can be used to get on the island without swimming. Recce the crossing. "\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{64536925F5CBB527}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Situation Enemy"
     m_sContent "The locals say there are almost 50 people coming towards us. These Canadians are well armed and have optics. They don't appear to have any vehicles."\
     ""\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{98A8AA9C0B1CE088}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Situation Friendly"
     m_sContent "1 Platoon is at full strength with an detachment rifle section from 2 platoon and a weapons section detachment. The platoon has also been given 8 demoblocks and clackers to destroy any caches on the island. They are located on a log on the dirt track. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{2ECF0F370D06ADA3}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Situation Friendly"
     m_sContent "At full strength we have 22 freedom fighters ready to destroy any Canadians that attack us. The Russian instructors training us will need to lead and fight with us during this fight. "\
     ""\
     "The cache contains placeable sandbags and bushes we can use to fortify the area"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7D410D83449651A1}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "1 Platoon will locate and destroy any separatists or caches located on the Zherebets Island in order to stop all separatist activity in the area. "\
     ""\
     "1 Platoon will locate and destroy any separatists or caches located on the Zherebets Island in order to stop all separatist activity in the area. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{15AA0EC6245BC13D}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "We must repel the Canadian attack at all cost while still maintaining our manpower and preventing them from destroying our cache. Once the Attack is stopped, we can try to relocate to a new area to set up camp. "\
     ""\
     "We must repel the Canadian attack at all cost while still maintaining our manpower and preventing them from destroying our cache. Once the Attack is stopped, we can try to relocate to a new area to set up camp. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5726B3C2BF87C026}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "Command and Signals"
     m_sContent "Platoon Leader - 11"\
