     m_sContent "The cache contains placeable sandbags and bushes we can use to fortify the area"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{DF4D21E7C72D0A8F}" {
     m_iOrder 13
     m_sTitle "End Conditions"
     m_sContent "End Conditions:"\
     "Canadians takes 90% casualties, Russian victory. Mission will end in 3 minutes or a GM can end it prior."\
     "Separatists take 100% Casualties, Canadian Victory. Mission will end instantly."\
     "Canadians destroys the cache, Canadian victory. Mission will end instantly."\
     ""\
     "Note for people like BoomerX. If you are the defending team CO and you don't defend the cache from being destroyed, you are going against the mission statement. You don't need to be on the objective but the mission will end instantly the Canadians destroy captures cache. If a GM or admin sees BoomerX about to do a BoomerX thing and waste an hour of everyones life, please take action within reason."
    }
   }
